sequenceDiagram
    actor Caller as Internal caller
    participant Command as Command model
    participant CR as Command repository
    participant Service as CommandService
    participant Execution as Execution snapshot
    participant ER as Execution repository

    Caller->>Command: create command
    Command->>Command: validate metadata and payload
    alt Invalid command
        Command-->>Caller: validation exception
    else Valid command
        Command-->>Caller: UavCommand
        Caller->>CR: save(command)
        CR-->>Caller: stored command
        Caller->>Service: create(commandId, operatorSessionId)
        Service->>CR: findById(commandId)
        CR-->>Service: stored command
        Service->>Execution: create(command, PENDING, session)
        Execution-->>Service: immutable snapshot
        Service->>ER: save(snapshot)
        ER-->>Service: stored snapshot
        Service-->>Caller: PENDING execution
    end
    Note over Caller,ER: Later snapshots may be stored directly if the command is unchanged and the timestamp is not older.
    Note over Caller,ER: No external receipt, target lookup, UAV dispatch, ACK, result, retry, or timeout workflow exists yet.
